\cf2 \cb7 Transparent models allow developers to understand how inputs are transformed into outputs, making it easier to identify and correct errors or inefficiencies in the model. This capability is crucial for optimizing the model\'92s performance and ensuring it behaves as expected.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

