\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A media company is developing generative AI applications on AWS to automate content creation and enhance customer engagement. Given the sensitivity of customer data and the complexity of AI models, the company\'92s security team wants to implement a defense-in-depth security approach to protect both the data and the AI infrastructure.\cb1 \
