\f3\b \cb7 Amazon SageMaker Ground Truth
\f1\b0 \'a0- Amazon SageMaker Ground Truth offers the most comprehensive set of human-in-the-loop capabilities, allowing you to harness the power of human feedback across the ML lifecycle to improve the accuracy and relevancy of models. You can complete a variety of human-in-the-loop tasks with SageMaker Ground Truth, from data generation and annotation to model review, customization, and evaluation, either through a self-service or an AWS-managed offering.\cb1 \

\f3\b \cb7 Amazon SageMaker Clarify
