\f2\fs32 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs38\fsmilli19200 \cf6 \cb7 \strokec6 Amazon Mechanical Turk and Amazon Ground Truth are the same service, used interchangeably for any task involving human intelligence\cb1 \
