\f2\fs32 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs38\fsmilli19200 \cf6 \cb7 \strokec6 SageMaker Ground Truth automatically generates synthetic data for training reinforcement learning models without any human intervention\cb1 \
