\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A technology consulting firm is advising a client on the use of AI to enhance their business operations, particularly through the implementation of large-scale models that can handle diverse tasks such as text generation, image recognition, and natural language understanding. The firm is evaluating Foundation Models as a potential solution and wants to clarify their capabilities, including their ability to generalize across multiple domains and perform a wide range of tasks with minimal fine-tuning.\cb1 \
