\f3\b \cb7 Cloud computing involves manually managing physical data centers and networking hardware for data storage and processing
\f1\b0 \'a0- Cloud computing reduces the need for manual management of physical data centers and networking hardware by providing these resources via the internet.\cb1 \

\f3\b \cb7 Cloud computing is the practice of using only open-source software for all computing needs
\f1\b0 \'a0- Cloud computing can involve both proprietary and open-source software, but it is not limited to open-source solutions.\cb1 \
