\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A technology company is considering using Amazon Web Services (AWS) to support its growing application infrastructure and is exploring different cloud computing models. The team is particularly interested in Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (EC2) to handle its scalable compute needs, as understanding this will help them determine how much control they have over the underlying infrastructure and how best to manage their resources.\cb1 \
